    "id": "megarian-capacity-shared-predicates",
    "logic": "Constructive Lean propositions; no excluded-middle assumption. Certificates are zero-axiom.",
    "frame": "No accessibility relation: ability is the primitive two-place predicate CanBe of Metaphysics IX.6 (DEF-CAPACITY-TO-BE), not a Kripke possibility operator, and actuality is the primitive InAct (DEF-ACT). No time index: the thesis and both conditionals are read at one shared evaluation.",
    "domain": "Arbitrary carriers Being and Respect (Type 0); no inhabitedness assumed. The registered controls use Unit for both.",
    "identity": "Literal Lean equality within each carrier; the same MovedIn, InAct and CanBe are shared by every assumption, so no premise can read ability or actuality in another sense.",
